{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af1473f","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"v8TfY-b4W5ygOv7r-syHq","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# Dplyr\n\nDplyr provides the primary toolkit for data transformation in R. Functions like `mutate()`, `filter()`, `select()`, `arrange()`, and `summarise()` cover the most common transformation tasks. Combined with the pipe operator, dplyr code reads clearly as a sequence of transformation steps applied to a dataset.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"dplyr","url":"https://dplyr.tidyverse.org/","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a13"},{"type":"video","title":"Dplyr Essentials","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gvhkp-Yw65U","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a14"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/v8TfY-b4W5ygOv7r-syHq.md"}